    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fuga Misri ghwanaaw Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ghoang'eat Rehoboamu gheambalmeadaanyi nea ninyas uurda, gafool diigheanda NG'UTAMIIDA, nea fuga sean bea Israeli gwandeayi sea niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba gweaydeaba muut bea sugoocheanduumeeda Rehoboamu, aba gideaba mii doobiiweadi aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ghwahidu Shishakeeda was sugoocheanda Misri gang'uchi sea fuga Yerusalemu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea gaba mutukwaji sagalama ea bughalaji iyeenya ea fih sagalamnyooji laadam ding'iida faraasajeega. Nea fuga adeana niny ea manda mooneeda nyaawa was gea leabu Misri, ea Libya, ea Sukimu, ea fuga Gushi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanda mujiinajeega sineaweesa hilooga bea Yuda ak ghapka ea ghwahidu Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwahidu Shemayeeda was sibaneeda heeda Rehoboamu ea heeda fuga Yuda, nea nibassa geat Yerusalemu aba gheawalmeeda Shishaki, ak gwayeesha saawa, “Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, ‘Agooga noojaktanean, ak eara agooga neajakseegwa geatinga Shishaki.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata fuga hees bea Israeli sea sugoocheanda ghwaat geat ng'eanyi ak gwayi, “NG'UTAMIIDA ea doabiiwaat.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwadaah NG'UTAMIIDA gideaba niyaat geat ng'eanyi, ghwahidu ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA heeda Shemaya: “Niyaat geat ng'eanyi; maygudu dahuuyda saawa, gaydanyaksa lealeanooda, nea nyarasteanyu ea maygudu gaweesa Yerusalemu aba geatinda Shishaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara gwasa gayghoah fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda, ak abeeda gayghwanal gadiyeedeanyu ea gadiyeeda gheambalmoojiga darooraka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata Shishakeeda was sugoocheanda Misri gwadiyeani gang'uchi sea Yerusalemu; ng'ata gageanda haleanjeeda siitiiw mida jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea gea mida jeeda gheeda sugoocheanda. Hean ghwaat haleanjeeda sean. Ng'ata ghwaat eara igeambooniga sisna dahaabu ghayi sin Sulemani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea sugoocheanda was Rehoboamu gwasin igeambooniga gharinga gaweay hoorgeeda gea siyaat ak ghwayiin geatinga fuga miineadayiisa furiischoodiga, was gea fura gidaghuuta gheeda sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iissa Iinyo gawa sugoocheanda jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, inyeesa gweana geadi furiischoodiga ama ng'ata ghoadealda jeeda gheeda furiischoodiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea inyeesa iiyaat geaw ng'eanyi hean ghang'amwa headaanyi nyarasta NG'UTAMIIDA, ea mudu gwajagu nyariida; aba gicha, ng'eanyiida Yuda gwanda giibinda miy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giinuweasta gidambaliischeata Rehoboamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean sugoocheanda was Rehoboamu goombaliischi aba Yerusalemu nea gooheadiischi uurdaanyi. Rehoboamu gaba gweanyeew haradam ea agi damanda ang'eat gheambalmeeda, hean goombaliischi gweanyeew damanispwa aba Yerusalemu, mujiineeda ghayi nighwal NG'UTAMIIDA aba jeeda eemoojiga sean bea Israeli was heeda jea ghwayiin gheawungaaschi. Gheawunga ghaamwat geeguura Naama bea eemeeda Amoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin ng'asheega munyas, aba gideaba mwaahang'waanya gurooroadaanyi aba gasooda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghamneawa gadiyoojiga Rehoboamu, gidang'eada madeeda ea gagul huuydeanda meeng'oorsiina jeeda damanyoojiga bea Shemayeeda was sibaneeda ea Ido was siida ng'ushta? Nea abeeda gwanda ng'ucheeda measha aba heeda Rehoboamu sea Yeroboamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghami Rehoboamu ak geebung'sa murdeeda ghweanigaaschi, ak geebung'sa jeeda mujiineeda Dawdi; ama ng'ata goombaliischi aba hoorgeadaanyi Abiyaheeda was orjeedaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
